<title>USA: IPO PRICING- Flagstar prices below range.</title>
<headline>IPO PRICING- Flagstar prices below range.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Company Name	     Flagstar Bancorp Inc</p>
<p>   Priced At					 $13</p>
<p>   Estimated Pricing Range	     $19 - $21</p>
<p>   Number of Shares			5,000,000</p>
<p>   Lead Underwriter		Lehman Brothers</p>
<p>NOTE: The proposed number of shares for the planned initial public offering was reduced to five million shares from 8.05 million shares previously.</p>
</text>
